MacroVisionKit — https://github.com/TheBoredTeam/MacroVisionKit
Used for: fullscreen-space detection (Sources/GlancyKit/Surface/SystemEvents.swift,
`FullscreenSpaces`): on NSWorkspace.activeSpaceDidChangeNotification, read
CGSCopyManagedDisplaySpaces and treat a display's current space as fullscreen when it carries a
TileLayoutManager.

