mediaremote-adapter — https://github.com/ungive/mediaremote-adapter
Commit 29718252613a5b0e210bdc64de0bd944ab379706, vendored unmodified in Vendor/mediaremote-adapter.
Used for: reading now-playing information (Sources/GlancyKit/Media/). The Perl script and the
